{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-81","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：可公度量与截差无理线段与中项无理线段","englishTitle":"To a second apotome of a medial straight line only one medial straight line can be annexed which is commensurable with the whole in square only and which contains with the whole a medial rectangle.","book":10,"number":81,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.81","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.81/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":81,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","contentId":"euclid-10-81","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4fa964577c5e956bd784a26ddfa7fcaf582753a3bcdd36ecfb9650f6723d9928","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-81.statement","euclid-10-81.construction.1","euclid-10-81.proof.1","euclid-10-81.proof.2","euclid-10-81.construction.2","euclid-10-81.proof.3","euclid-10-81.proof.4","euclid-10-81.proof.5","euclid-10-81.proof.6","euclid-10-81.proof.7","euclid-10-81.proof.8","euclid-10-81.proof.9","euclid-10-81.proof.10","euclid-10-81.proof.11","euclid-10-81.proof.12","euclid-10-81.proof.13","euclid-10-81.proof.14","euclid-10-81.proof.15","euclid-10-81.proof.16","euclid-10-81.proof.17","euclid-10-81.conclusion","euclid-10-81.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-81.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-81","revisionId":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"30a805d3414a26729a9d61c7cdf383668b2ccab34db6e942363664b6b5fdb885","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To a second apotome of a medial straight line only one medial straight line can be annexed which is commensurable with the whole in square only and which contains with the whole a medial rectangle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"中项无理线段只可附在截差无理线段枚鱼雷中的1 中项无理线段枚鱼雷,可公度枚只附在正方形枚鱼雷中,其中中项无理线段 矩形枚鱼雷全部附在其中。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-81.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-81","revisionId":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b80906d9ac6f4ba5f868243f7e09d32e2f597c5112d15e68e9247f0602f19fb6","citations":["euclid-10-75"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be a second apotome of a medial straight line and BC an annex to AB; therefore AC, CB are medial straight lines commensurable in square only and such that the rectangle AC, CB which they contain is medial. [[X. 75](/principles/euclid-10-75)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是第中项无理线段和BC附件中的第二截差无理线段;因此,AC、CB是第中项无理线段、平方可公度而长度不可公度,其所含的矩形、AC、CB是第中项无理线段。 [[X. 75](/principles/euclid-10-75)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-81.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-81","revisionId":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"972333c8bbb263d909f264af39ca3f811cb7f4092aab0af86ddb2fa09333f856","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that no other medial straight line can be annexed to AB which is commensurable with the whole in square only and which contains with the whole a medial rectangle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,其他中项无理线段件不能附在AB件之后,即可公度件,全部在正方形件,其中含有中项无理线段 矩形件。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-81.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-81","revisionId":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4dd36fbe094c5f3e9de47dc1576cc287b8d47bfae3cfe2dcf9e65d499a8f58cd","citations":["euclid-10-75"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let BD also be so annexed; therefore AD, DB are also medial straight lines commensurable in square only and such that the rectangle AD, DB which they contain is medial. [[X. 75](/principles/euclid-10-75)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能的话,将BD件也列为附件;因此,AD、DB件也是中项无理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度件,其中的矩形 AD件是中项无理线段件。 [[X. 75](/principles/euclid-10-75)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-81.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-81","revisionId":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"44e479639ee0b51fa5565cc402d3a12dbaaa29f2e398eaa2ff70d0d5e91b6e9a","citations":["euclid-2-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a rational straight line EF be set out, let EG equal to the squares on AC, CB be applied to EF, producing EM as breadth, and let HG equal to twice the rectangle AC, CB be subtracted, producing HM as breadth; therefore the remainder EL is equal to the square on AB, [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)] so that AB is the side of EL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"列出有理线段 EF,EG等于正方形,AC,CB适用于EF,宽度扩大为EM,将HG等于矩形 AC,CB减去两倍,宽度扩大为HM;因此,其余EL等于AB,宽度扩大为正方形,EL,AB是EL的一边。 [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-81.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-81","revisionId":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5fbe421c2f6672288f0ff32f80605804115feb3f3d7310d4dee4d76737e516e3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, let EI equal to the squares on AD, DB be applied to EF, producing EN as breadth."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,EI等于AD,DB适用于EF,宽度扩大为EN。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-81.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-81","revisionId":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"863a173c9e419642ee4c9d9bb851e4320a335191a6f331332b069c1edbffe797","citations":["euclid-2-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But EL is also equal to the square on AB; therefore the remainder HI is equal to twice the rectangle AD, DB. [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但EL等于AB的正方形;因此,其余HI等于矩形 AD,DB的两倍。 [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-81.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-81","revisionId":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4fde8ce9262849fd831af2d2b326ca4f61a1598fe324c5eab611c0e34a821150","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since AC, CB are medial straight lines, therefore the squares on AC, CB are also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,AC,CB是中项无理线段, 所以AC,CB也是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-81.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-81","revisionId":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2e1b2f5a6dd8cc6c579f44cd8048fe3e8b370487e9f9a104c2f82e7b83009b22","citations":["euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And they are equal to EG; therefore EG is also medial. [[X. 15 and 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"等于EG,因此EG也是中项无理线段。 [[X. 15 and 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-81.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-81","revisionId":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6232364a88cb53832277c3bbbf47330ecee665b336dd19626ea9bcd544f45ee9","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line EF, producing EM as breadth; therefore EM is rational and incommensurable in length with EF. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其范围扩大到EM宽,因此,EM长为有理,不可公度长为EF。 [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-81.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-81","revisionId":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"723810edd79572365e85449646a546d6ee77db8f24cfc1ba7738b9d9baa5824e","citations":["euclid-10-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since the rectangle AC, CB is medial, twice the rectangle AC, CB is also medial. [[X. 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-23)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于矩形 AC,CB是中项无理线段,是矩形 AC的两倍,CB也是中项无理线段。 [[X. 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-81.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-81","revisionId":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d5ba8cab77d176212f69abd5a7519a7876c09aa7b5803ecf7a7c67d2c936c242","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is equal to HG; therefore HG is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"等于HG,因此HG也是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-81.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-81","revisionId":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed87858ad0f4c29925d5cbfd79413c889d0a89e70dee7cc1f50b6ed9f509caa4","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line EF, producing HM as breadth; therefore HM is also rational and incommensurable in length with EF. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其范围扩大到HM宽,因此HM长为有理和不可公度长为EF。 [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-81.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-81","revisionId":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ca7f2fca48d11aa5532d586491ead4a7d21b2ce63233b554aa91323a7f711693","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AC, CB are commensurable in square only, therefore AC is incommensurable in length with CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC,CB是平方可公度而长度不可公度 所以AC是不可公度,CB是CB"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-81.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-81","revisionId":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5c62e04e1f83131d4ffc11286c73f0ede5342b151abf59bc53eb09443ee81ccc","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as AC is to CB, so is the square on AC to the rectangle AC, CB; therefore the square on AC is incommensurable with the rectangle AC, CB. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AC对CB的比等于AC对正方形对矩形对AC对CB的比;因此,AC对正方形对不可公度对不可公度对矩形对CB的比是不可公度对矩形对AC对CB [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-81.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-81","revisionId":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ea946410c93effcb1e045fa8e37f097a3567ca2acee1802dc4d7a4153388b45f","citations":["euclid-10-6","euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the squares on AC, CB are commensurable with the square on AC, while twice the rectangle AC, CB is commensurable with the rectangle AC, CB; [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)] therefore the squares on AC, CB are incommensurable with twice the rectangle AC, CB. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AC,CB的正方形是可公度,AC的正方形是不可公度,而矩形,AC,CB的两倍是可公度,矩形,AC,CB;因此,AC的正方形,CB是不可公度,不可公度,矩形,AC的两倍是不可公度。 [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)] [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-81.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-81","revisionId":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"76985b98b5dfc882bdb57f97243b50553a65d0d8152b43bdcac4fadb70b5e9e4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And EG is equal to the squares on AC, CB, while GH is equal to twice the rectangle AC, CB; therefore EG is incommensurable with HG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EG等于AC的正方形,CB,GH等于矩形,AC,CB的两倍,因此EG等于不可公度,HG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-81.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-81","revisionId":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dc25bb91fea5ad638d692c2bba1a4edf285b00b01051222a074fd25de496b81d","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as EG is to HG, so is EM to HM; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore EM is incommensurable in length with MH. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,EG比HG等于EM比HM,因此,EM比EG等于MH；EG 与 HG 之比等于 EM 与 HM 之比；上述对应量不可公度。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-81.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-81","revisionId":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"064da788a1b30242e781029327525041534b5c97c90a0107a7070f1bbbb384f0","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And both are rational; therefore EM, MH are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore EH is an apotome, and HM an annex to it. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两者均为有理;因此,EM,MH是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;因此,EH是截差无理线段,HM是其附件。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-81.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-10-81","revisionId":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bd6635c86ba9e693901b61d2b1389595964efa096b187f78a858ddc97a641ce0","citations":["euclid-10-79"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that HN is also an annex to it; therefore to an apotome different straight lines are annexed which are commensurable with the wholes in square only: which is impossible. [[X. 79](/principles/euclid-10-79)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,HN也是其附件;因此,截差无理线段不同的直线被附在附件,而可公度直线仅以正方形计,不可能。 [[X. 79](/principles/euclid-10-79)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-81.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-81","revisionId":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","order":20,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-81.source","contentId":"euclid-10-81","revisionId":"euclid-10-81@raw-4fa964577c5e956b","order":21,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2cc4e4dc04aaa8a9962508e6fed4356640b0d59c0222c30a4342788848d7fd5b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.81/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.81\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-81:euclid-10-75:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-81","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-81.construction.1","euclid-10-81.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-75","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"u